      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NAVY DAVIES (1) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 4.5 lengths win at Shepparton in a handy 22.40. Nicely placed here on the inside and likes the trip. Unbeaten from this box in three starts. Well placed and can measure up. PAW DROGO (2) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 3.5 lengths fourth (22.51) over 390m at this track. Likely to be thereabouts. SIR EASY (7) boasts a strong record this journey with two wins and two minors from five tries. Hit the frame latest (25.50) when third at Shepparton in a Restricted WIN H. Looks a key chance on best figures. ROVANIEMI (4) is worth consideration after filling a hole at this course and distance last start.",
